  "source": "crates.io resolves a crate name in any case: the API at crates.io/api/v1/crates returned serde_json for Serde_JSON and serde for SERDE on 2026-10-15. crates.io also treats - and _ as one character (serde-json resolved to serde_json), but the fold keeps both, so the published name stays as written. The version is semver and stays raw.",
